abstract: "3D routing and urban mobility analysis for 15 user profiles (wheelchair, senior, child, bicycle, scooter, car, truck...): slope-aware shortest paths, Pareto routes, isochrones, OD matrices, accessibility and walkability audits, and an interactive 3D route viewer."
